INSERT INTO `complaint` VALUES (1,'1256','Car Sold to multiple people, transferred RC not provided by dealer','Yash Bagga','yashbagga','7876201046','Haryana','Ambala Cantt','yash.bagga@hotmail.com','Please register the complaint against the dealer as shown underneath: Dealer Name: Yuvraj Car Bazaar Membership No.: 1256 Contact:+91-9416320598/8950210006 Vehicle No.:HR 29 M 9355 Selling Commission charged: INR 5000/- Vehicle Sold for: INR 95000/- 1. The vehicle has been sold to various persons but has till date not provided me the transferred RC in the other persons name.The same is being followed up for since December 2014, but the dealer is repeatedly asking me to chase with the other party to whom the car is being sold and is straightforwardly denying any support. 2. I am being provided with a copy of sale receipt for AICDA by the dealer in addition to other docs. Kindly help to resolve the issue prior to taking the legal channel as last resort. Regards,','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(2,'no number','union fall','Good luck car bazaar','babullal agarwal','9351374708','jaipur . rajasthan','jaipur','agarwal.babulal16@gmail.com','Sir.jaipur s babulal agarwal why the regen with in 5 year no association in jaipur. kha karan h ke yaha per koi union nhe h why......... ajay bhatiya n 3100 rs lay kar bhi aaj tak 5year mmamber nhe banaya h why...........','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(3,'1','Cheated by Matoshree Yash Motors, Pune','Matoshree Yash Motors, Pune','Anand Ranjalkar','09881078989','Maharashtra','Pune','RanjalkarAnand@JohnDeere.com','Dear Sir, This is a complaint against Matoshree Yash Motors, Pune which is member of AICDA. I purchased a 2004 Automatic Santro from MY Motors in June-14. I purchased the car from MY Motors under good faith and trust that the car is road worthy and repairable in reasonable cost. However later I found that the car was not road worthy as automatic gear box of Hyundai is not easily available and costs more than Rs. 100,000. The insurance policy of the car was not given to me immediately because the IDV of the car was Rs. 0. I was completely shocked due to the unethical and dishonest dealing of MY Motors. Finally I had to convert this automatic car to manual and had to spend Rs. 100,000 to make the car road worthy. You are requested to look into the complaint as give relief to me.','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(4,'744','Regarding the cheating and fraudcase','Vaishno Motors','Mohd Kamran','9990501491','Delhi','Delhi','mohd.kamran1988@gmail.com','On date 23rd of Jan 2016, I Just want to purchase a Hyundai I10 Model from Vaishno Motors Karol Bagh With Mem#744 and Reg#S-55924/2006, I was Agreed to Purchase the Car Since the Car Was in a good Condition While We Checked it However We Were Agree to Pay the Amount Since The Dealer Was Registered from All India Car Dealers Association and We had a deal for Hyundai I10 Reg No. DL10CA 3848. And The dealer has collected 10,000/ as Token Amount.On the promises and assurances of Mr Manish Nagpal that the Condition of the Car will remain same and We Will give you all documents Once the rest of the amount will be paid.When I checked the vehicle After Few Days, It was not in a good condition He did not provide all the documents of the car.I request you to,please help me in getting my money back','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(5,'744','Regarding the cheating and fraudcase','Vaishno Motors','Mohd Kamran','9990501491','Delhi','Delhi','mohd.kamran1988@gmail.com','On date 23rd of Jan 2016, I Just want to purchase a Hyundai I10 Model from Vaishno Motors Karol Bagh With Membership Number-744 I was Agreed to Purchase the Car Since the Car Was in a good Condition While We Checked it However We Were Agree to Pay the Amount Since The Dealer Was Registered from All India Car Dealers Association and We had a deal for Hyundai I10 Reg No. DL10CA 3848.The dealer has collected 10,000/ as Token Amount.On the promises and assurances of Mr Manish Nagpal that the Condition of the Car will remain same and We Will give you all documents Once the rest of the amount will be paid.he made false promises of giving the car in a good Condition, also assured me that if you will not find the Car in a Good Condition ,he will refund the amount back.plz help in getting my money','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(6,'744','Regarding the cheating and fraudcase','Vaishno Motors','Mohd Kamran','9990501491','Delhi','Delhi','mohd.kamran1988@gmail.com','I am sending you the request third time, for fraud case against membership#744, I look forward to settling this matter amicably. If, however, the matter is not satisfactorily resolved As Soon As possible, I will consider taking further action to resolve the complaint either through the upper level or through the courts.against the All India Car Dealers Association,since why do you registered these fraud dealers with your membership. Either Cancel the Membership of the Dealer otherwise help me in getting my money back.','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(7,'m not a mamber','buy a used car','amit mehta','amit mehta','9828420803','rajasthan','pali','amit21616@gmail.com','sir, i buy a used car from ganpati car bazar udaipur,. he drop me pic on whatsapp and i argue for buying..... when i pik the car i seen car is not as well as pics and not in gud condistion.... m just speek to ashok kabra and told abt that..... he repling me that he reapire the car as well as...... i paid full amount and transfer all paper on my name ...... but they not repier the car and al last he told me that he is not reapring the car.....','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(8,'1312','NON RECEIPT OF BALANCE PAYMENT','SHARMA CAR BAZAAR','ASHOK GOYAL','9417620863','PUNJAB','BATHINDA','ashokgoyaluco1956@gmail.com','Dear Sir, I have sold my Hyundai i20 car 2010 Model white colour through M/s Sharma Car Bazaar, Opp Kapson Showroom Bhatinda on 27.11.2016 at 18:30 P.M. The buyer was Sh. Suresh Kumar Sharma S/O Sham Lal Sharma Back Side Gali No. 5 Bhatinda as written on delivery receipt. The car was sold for Rs.367500/-. Out of which Rs.25000/- was made cash on 27.11.2016 for the rest of the amount Cheque was issued dated 05/12/2016 of amount Rs.342500/- . The cheque was put on clearing on 05/12/2016 the cheque got dishonoured on same day. As the cheque got dishonoured due account inoperative. Now nor the captioned dealer nor owner is coming forward to pay the rest of the amount. ASHOK KUMAR GOYAL 9417620863','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(9,'709','My card & other items not received','Royal car point','Palvinder Singh','9464047723','Punjab','Sangrur','jassal_1989@yahoo.co.in','My membership card and other materials not available me.','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(10,'123456788','Sold my car but not yet transferred','ARVINDER KAUR','ARVINDER KAUR','9899880044','New Delhi','DELHU','amanpreet0704@gmail.com','Hello , respected sir I am ARVINDER KAUR previous owner of car DL8CP5731 MARUTI RITZ , I had sold my car to cars24 on 6june2020. It\'s around 2 months , still car is not yet transferred . I am getting challan daily of overspeeding. I have made my complaint at cars 24 but no action taken from there end . Within 2 months 5 Challans were issued of overspeeding . Please help us out Yours faithfully ARVINDER KAUR Bu 205 pitampura Vishakha enclave New Delhi 9899880044','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(11,'Buckinghamshire','Generic Cotton Bike','Devin Turner','Wooden','17...17','Georgia','Bernhardville','srampy@univ-wea.com','Designer','2021-12-17 09:29:36'),(14,'12345678','Refund of conditional token','Car Studio','Sukhpreet','9711333865','Punjab','Mohali','sukh_mahan@yahoo.com','Hi I paid conditional token to Car Studio Mohali (Plot Number C149, Ind Area, Phase 7 Mohali, Near Esi Hospital). Token was paid as a conditional amount and the dealership confirmed that it will be refunded if car is not satisfactory post inspection. The car no is CH01BC0195 mercedes E250 2015 model. I got the car inspected at Joshi Mercedes in chandigarh and paid 10000. for inspection. I was not satisfied after the inspection report and requested dealership to rerun conditional token of 25000. Not the dealership is refusing post multiple requests. Hence i am filling a compliant to the association for a fair deal. \r\n\r\n\r\n','2022-04-06 07:24:45'),(15,'3450','Transfer and RC related complaint','LUCKY CARZ','Anil Kumar','9876941005','Haryana ','Manimajra Chandigarh','anilnagar1984@gmail.com','R/Sir \r\nI bought Honda BR-V by the mentioned car dealer Lucky CARZ. While closing the deal it is made sure that RC transfer(3500 Rupees)will be charged by the dealer side, in all receipt or signed documents the balance amount is shown NIL. But after 1month when RC was transferred at my name the dealer is demanding 3500 rupees. To manipulate or prove his lie true he entered the 5500 rupees balance amount in child written font in their record register although above this amount NIL is written it is clearly seen that it is written later. I attached the photo of this along with all proofs as well in Google drive link . Secondly he is taking any action from his side about the owner name change in the vehicle insurance policy documents. Just telling the process that it is easy or ek din ka Kam hi kava dege. Some other documents like Vehicle owner manual is not given to me if he took from the real owner of this vehicle then he should ...Sir please look into this matter and solve it as soon as possible. Sir ,this is not the matter of 3500 rupees but matter of good trading practice or bad one.\r\nThank you\r\nAnil Kumar\r\nEnclose- link of Google drive-https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rLh8vOJW8SdKWgvTJiZsln5rp10mUIX9/view?usp=drivesdk\r\n','2022-11-24 06:29:07'),(16,'Ganpaticarsudaipur','Fraud by selling me a fake and damaged car','Ganpati cars','Harshit sharma','9414058555','Rajasthan','Udaipur ','chhotuharshit@gmail.com','à¤¸à¤° à¤®à¥ˆà¤‚à¤¨à¥‡ à¤—à¤£à¤ªà¤¤à¤¿ à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥à¤¸ à¤‰à¤¦à¤¯à¤ªà¥à¤° à¤¸à¥‡ à¤¸à¤¿à¤¤à¤‚à¤¬à¤° à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤à¤• à¤•à¤¾à¤° à¤¬à¤²à¥‡à¤¨à¥‹ à¤¡à¥€à¤œà¤² à¤…à¤²à¥à¤«à¤¾ à¤¬à¥à¤²à¥‚ à¤•